A licence change is coming, and has not happened yet
================================================================================

`anymex_extension_runtime_bridge` is published under the Unabandon Public
License, which incorporates the GNU General Public License Version 3 and adds
a requirement that derivative works' source be publicly available.

GPLv3 is copyleft. Apache-2.0 code may be combined into a GPLv3 work; the
reverse is not permitted. So a build that links that bridge is a GPLv3
derivative work, and this file and LICENSE must change to match.

That has NOT happened. The bridge is not a dependency of this project today,
and until it is, the Apache-2.0 statement above is the accurate one. The flip
belongs in the same commit that adds the dependency — not before it, or the
claim would be false.
